#  also puts createItemTwo back into "not yet on the list" state for the
#  bulk-add section below.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### setup — attach the second item so there's something to remove
POST http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/lists/{{createListWithEventDate.response.body.id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

{
  "itemId": "{{createItemTwo.response.body.id}}"
}

