Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

###

### ❌ 400 — invalid list id
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/lists/not-a-uuid/items/{{createItemTwo.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

###

### ✅ 204 — remove the item from the list
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/lists/{{createListWithEventDate.response.body.id}}/items/{{createItemTwo.response.body.id}}
