# ══════════════════════════════════════════
#  POST /lists/:id/pack-all
#
#  Both createItem and createItemTwo are on createListWithEventDate after
#  the bulk-add section above. createItem may already be isPacked: true
#  from the PATCH section earlier — pack-all still 204s and is the thing
#  to check via GET /lists/:id afterward to confirm both items show
#  isPacked: true.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### ✅ 204 — pack every item on the list at once
POST http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/lists/{{createListWithEventDate.response.body.id}}/pack-all
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

###

### ❌ 404 — list does not exist
POST http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/lists/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/pack-all
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

###

### ❌ 400 — invalid list id
POST http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/lists/not-a-uuid/pack-all
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}


# ══════════════════════════════════════════
#  POST /lists/:id/unpack-all
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### ✅ 204 — unpack every item on the list at once (undoes pack-all above —
#          check GET /lists/:id afterward to confirm both items now show
#          isPacked: false)
POST http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/lists/{{createListWithEventDate.response.body.id}}/unpack-all
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

